{"3367710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Abyss Break", "steam_appid": 3367710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Abyss Break</strong> is a hardcore first-person co-op horror game where you and your team venture into dangerous parallel worlds born from the Abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up with no memory in an underground complex scarred by disaster. There are no people left here — only a semi-autonomous hub and a path into foreign worlds. There, beyond the Abyss, you will have to gather resources, search for gear, and piece together the truth of what happened to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every venture brings you closer to the answers: what happened in the complex, who you really are, and why realities keep collapsing one after another. But the farther you go, the clearer it becomes: the Abyss has rules of its own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Favors the Prepared</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367710/extras/e214828296a605001626098b6df98383.poster.avif?t=1779976697\" width=616 height=179 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367710/extras/e214828296a605001626098b6df98383.webm?t=1779976697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have full control over how you arrange your pouches, armor plates, and support gear. Customize your weapons with attachments like suppressors, magazines, sights, and more to suit your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Is Against You</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367710/extras/4795394a1d4012158a7d8f933c6e2737.poster.avif?t=1779976697\" width=616 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367710/extras/4795394a1d4012158a7d8f933c6e2737.webm?t=1779976697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367710/extras/4795394a1d4012158a7d8f933c6e2737.mp4?t=1779976697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Abyss is unstable — an alien reality is about to tear you apart. Return before it’s too late. But remember, rushing blindly might attract too much attention.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stronger Together</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367710/extras/0d5438bbbfeb6d835f112bb7cfcab0c6.poster.avif?t=1779976697\" width=616 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367710/extras/0d5438bbbfeb6d835f112bb7cfcab0c6.webm?t=1779976697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367710/extras/0d5438bbbfeb6d835f112bb7cfcab0c6.mp4?t=1779976697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form a team of up to three players, combining stealth, combat, resource gathering, and preparation to withstand relentless threats.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Total Immersion</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367710/extras/0b50f66cad4c81fa1abaa71ca4ec4ee1.poster.avif?t=1779976697\" width=616 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367710/extras/0b50f66cad4c81fa1abaa71ca4ec4ee1.webm?t=1779976697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367710/extras/0b50f66cad4c81fa1abaa71ca4ec4ee1.mp4?t=1779976697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world reacts to your actions — tracks, open doors, and missing resources won’t go unnoticed. With dynamic weather, a day-night cycle, and detailed environments, every mission feels unpredictable and immersive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is just the beginning! We’ll be revealing more story details and gameplay mechanics over time. <strong><u>Add it to your Wishlist so you don’t miss out!</u></strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Abyss Break</strong> is a hardcore first-person co-op horror game where you and your team venture into dangerous parallel worlds born from the Abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up with no memory in an underground complex scarred by disaster. There are no people left here — only a semi-autonomous hub and a path into foreign worlds. There, beyond the Abyss, you will have to gather resources, search for gear, and piece together the truth of what happened to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every venture brings you closer to the answers: what happened in the complex, who you really are, and why realities keep collapsing one after another. But the farther you go, the clearer it becomes: the Abyss has rules of its own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Favors the Prepared</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367710/extras/e214828296a605001626098b6df98383.poster.avif?t=1779976697\" width=616 height=179 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367710/extras/e214828296a605001626098b6df98383.webm?t=1779976697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have full control over how you arrange your pouches, armor plates, and support gear. Customize your weapons with attachments like suppressors, magazines, sights, and more to suit your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Is Against You</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367710/extras/4795394a1d4012158a7d8f933c6e2737.poster.avif?t=1779976697\" width=616 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367710/extras/4795394a1d4012158a7d8f933c6e2737.webm?t=1779976697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367710/extras/4795394a1d4012158a7d8f933c6e2737.mp4?t=1779976697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Abyss is unstable — an alien reality is about to tear you apart. Return before it’s too late. But remember, rushing blindly might attract too much attention.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stronger Together</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367710/extras/0d5438bbbfeb6d835f112bb7cfcab0c6.poster.avif?t=1779976697\" width=616 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367710/extras/0d5438bbbfeb6d835f112bb7cfcab0c6.webm?t=1779976697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367710/extras/0d5438bbbfeb6d835f112bb7cfcab0c6.mp4?t=1779976697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form a team of up to three players, combining stealth, combat, resource gathering, and preparation to withstand relentless threats.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Total Immersion</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367710/extras/0b50f66cad4c81fa1abaa71ca4ec4ee1.poster.avif?t=1779976697\" width=616 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367710/extras/0b50f66cad4c81fa1abaa71ca4ec4ee1.webm?t=1779976697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367710/extras/0b50f66cad4c81fa1abaa71ca4ec4ee1.mp4?t=1779976697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world reacts to your actions — tracks, open doors, and missing resources won’t go unnoticed. With dynamic weather, a day-night cycle, and detailed environments, every mission feels unpredictable and immersive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is just the beginning! We’ll be revealing more story details and gameplay mechanics over time. <strong><u>Add it to your Wishlist so you don’t miss out!</u></strong></p>", "short_description": "Hardcore first-person co-op horror game. Explore the worlds beyond the Abyss alone or with a team, gather what you need to survive, and discover how far consciousness can change before it is no longer your own.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, F